{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09001","headline":"寄卢庾 · 韦应物","name":"寄卢庾","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"悠悠远离别，分此欢会难。\n如何两相近，反使心不安。\n乱发思一栉，垢衣思一浣。\n岂如望友生，对酒起长叹。\n时节异京洛，孟冬天未寒。\n广陵多车马，日夕自游盘。\n独我何耿耿，非君谁爲欢。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"韦应物","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_09001.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_09001","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"五言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}